      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://extrachill.com/the-story-of-ketchuptown-sc/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Local celebrations in Ketchuptown once featured square dancing, fiddle music, and even the Charleston dance.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        21
