      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://extrachill.com/the-story-of-ketchuptown-sc/"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Before the town developed, the swampy terrain was navigated via wooden bridges and known as Over the Swamp.",
